So you want to push some changes but ignore a few changesets in between (aka Null integrate them to borrow a p4 term)


hg push

...
Now on the server side lets say you have a - b - c and you want to get rid of "b"

hg export c > c

hg up a

hg import c

Thats it, you ve fractured the tree and created c* but b will be gone along with its history. 

...
If you d done this on the client side you would have lost the change `b'. I m guessing you don't want that else we wouldnt be having
this conversation :-)


